```text
                USER APPROACHES DOOR
                         │
                         ▼
                 PIR MOTION DETECTED
                         │
                         ▼
                   RFID SCAN
                         │
                ┌────────┴────────┐
                │                 │
              VALID             INVALID
                │                 │
                ▼                 ▼
         PASSWORD /            ACCESS
        FINGERPRINT          DENIED
                │
        ┌───────┴────────┐
        │                │
      VALID            INVALID
        │                │
        ▼                ▼
   ACCESS GRANTED    SECURITY ALERT
        │
        ▼
   RELAY ACTIVATED
        │
        ▼
 ELECTROMAGNETIC LOCK
      UNLOCKED
        │
        ▼
   SERVO OPENS DOOR
        │
        ▼
   EVENT LOG SAVED
        │
        ▼
  DATA UPLOADED TO CLOUD
